{
  "$spec": "SPEC.md §7.6, §7.7, §8.5",
  "description": "Graph API error code → engine action. Actions: pause_campaign | stop_all_campaigns | retry_backoff (exponential + jitter, halve rate for 5 min) | retry_after_60s | retry_transient (max 3 attempts) | failed | failed_manual_retry_after_24h | failed_and_suppress. `retryable_by_retry_failed` is whether the S-08 'Retry failed' button includes the row.",
